## Accounts Worker
# Account service origin that /api/auth, /api/account, /oauth2 and /.well-known proxy to. (default: http://127.0.0.1:3002)
# ACCOUNT_SERVICE_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:3002
# Public Account origin and OAuth issuer base, the same value the Account service uses. (default: http://127.0.0.1:3004)
# ACCOUNT_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3004
# REZICS web origin linked from the Accounts header. (default: http://127.0.0.1:3000)
# WEB_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:3000
